Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.54,0:00:03.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I'm moving my infantry division...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.54,0:00:03.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 我要移动我的步兵师
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...augmented by a battalion of orcs from Lord of the Rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}后援是《魔戒》里的半兽人兵团
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:08.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We flank the Tennessee volunteers...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:08.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们从两侧包抄田纳西州义勇军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:12.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the North once again wins the Battle of Gettysburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:12.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}北军因此再次拿下 葛底斯堡战役的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:15.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not so fast. Remember, the South still has two infantry divisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:15.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}着什么急嘛 别忘了 南军还有两个步兵师
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plus Superman and Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以及超人和哥斯拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:19.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. Orcs are magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:19.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不…半兽人是魔法人物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.81,0:00:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Superman is vulnerable to magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.81,0:00:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}超人对魔法一筹莫展
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:23.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not to mention, you already lost Godzilla...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:23.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更别提你的哥斯拉已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.69,0:00:26.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to the Illinois cavalry and Hulk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.69,0:00:26.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被伊利诺伊骑兵团和绿巨人灭掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:30.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you just have Robert E. Lee charge the line with Shiva and Ganesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:30.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不让罗伯特爱德华李将军 率领湿婆神跟象神？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You guys ready to order? -Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们要点餐了吗？ -等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.28,0:00:33.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shiva and Ganesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.28,0:00:33.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}湿婆神跟象神？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.03,0:00:36.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Hindu gods against the entire Union Army?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.03,0:00:36.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}印度神对抗整个联邦军？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:38.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And orcs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:38.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有半兽人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我待会儿再来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:43.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me. Ganesh is the remover of obstacles and Shiva's the destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 象神能移除障碍 湿婆神是破坏王
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:46.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When the smoke clears, Lincoln will be speaking Hindi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:46.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}硝烟散去后 林肯就会开始一边说印地语
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.67,0:00:48.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and drinking mint juleps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.67,0:00:48.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一边喝薄荷朱利酒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:52.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My boss says you have to either order or leave and never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:52.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我老板说你们不点餐的话 就得永远离开别再回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.93,0:00:55.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you recommend for someone with a man-sized appetite...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.93,0:00:55.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对一个做了一早上 重量训练及有氧热舞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.93,0:00:58.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...from a morning of weight-training and cardio-funk?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.93,0:00:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而有成年人食量的男人 你会推荐什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:00:59.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:00:59.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冲澡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:03.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll take the heart-smart platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:03.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我点个有益于心脏的大拼盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, thank you. And Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 谢谢你 谢尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:07.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We don't eat here. I don't know what's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:07.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们从不在这里吃东西 我不知道有什么好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:10.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, it's all good. -Statistically unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:10.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所有的菜都很好吃 -从统计学角度说 几乎不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:13.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just get a hamburger. You like hamburgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:13.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}点汉堡吧 你喜欢汉堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.45,0:01:15.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I like the hamburgers where we usually eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.45,0:01:15.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢我们常去那家店的汉堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.62,0:01:18.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't make the assumption that I'll like the hamburgers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.62,0:01:18.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能因此推导出我喜欢这里的汉堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. Give him a hamburger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 给他点个汉堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:23.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which one, the classic, the ranch house...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:23.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哪种？经典汉堡、牧场汉堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.67,0:01:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the barbeque burger or the Kobe burger?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.67,0:01:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}烤肉汉堡还是神户牛肉汉堡？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:28.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can't we just go to Big Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:28.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就不能去大男孩餐厅吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.13,0:01:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-They only have one burger, the Big Boy. -The barbeque burger's like the Big Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.13,0:01:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他们只有一种 大男孩汉堡 -烤肉汉堡吃起来很像大男孩汉堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:35.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In a world that already includes a Big Boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:35.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很抱歉 既然这世界上 已经有大男孩汉堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.47,0:01:37.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...why would I settle for something like a Big Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.47,0:01:37.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么我要接受 像大男孩汉堡的汉堡？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:40.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because you are not at Big Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:40.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你不在大男孩餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.14,0:01:43.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Fine. I'll have the barbeque burger. -Make it two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.14,0:01:43.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧 我要烤肉汉堡 -我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:46.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Waitresses don't yell at you at Big Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:46.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大男孩餐厅的服务生不会对顾客大吼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:48.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Leonard. Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:48.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 莱纳德 大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey. -Hey, Leslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 -嘿 莱斯丽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I didn't know you ate here. -We don't. This is a disturbing aberration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不知道你们都在这里吃饭 -没有 这是令人困扰的脱序行为
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:57.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leslie, this is Penny, she lives across the hall from Sheldon and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:57.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱斯丽 她是佩妮 我和谢尔顿的对门邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:02:00.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And walks in quiet beauty like the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:02:00.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像黑夜一样 悄悄走进我们生命的美人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, I've asked you not to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 我说了别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:06.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leslie and I do research together at the university.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:06.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱斯丽跟我在大学里一起做研究
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:09.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, wow. A girl scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:09.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇 女科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.13,0:02:11.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yep. Come for the breasts, stay for the brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.13,0:02:11.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 胸部平平 脑袋一流
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I'm glad I ran into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很高兴碰到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:16.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Physics Department string quartet needs a new cellist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:16.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}物理系的弦乐四重奏需要新大提琴手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:18.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happened to Elliott Wong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:18.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾略特王怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:21.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Switched over to high-energy radiation research, had a mishap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:21.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他被调去高能量辐射研究小组了 出了点意外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:24.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And now the other guys are uncomfortable sitting next to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:24.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在大家都不想坐在他旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:26.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So are you in? -Yeah, sure. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要参加吗？ -当然 有何不可？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.69,0:02:30.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We rehearse on Tuesdays at your place. -Why at my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.69,0:02:30.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好极了 那星期二我们到你家练习 -为什么是我家？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:33.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, Department of Energy said our regular space is kind of a hot zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:33.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能源系说我们平常的练习地点是热区
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:36.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Nice meeting you. -Yeah, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:36.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-很高兴认识你 -我也很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.53,0:02:38.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, I didn't know you played the cello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.53,0:02:38.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我都不知道你会拉大提琴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.91,0:02:41.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, my parents felt that naming me Leonard...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.91,0:02:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爸妈觉得给我取名莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and putting me in advanced-placement classes...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后让我跳级念书
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.71,0:02:45.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...wasn't getting me beaten up enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.71,0:02:45.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对我来说磨练还是不够
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:48.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're into music, I happen to be a human beatbox...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:48.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你喜欢音乐 我刚好是人体节拍盒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:50.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...so.... -Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:51.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:52.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BEATBOXING]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:59.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm actually not that into music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:59.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有那么喜欢音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:03.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your friend's really cute. Anything going on with you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:03.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你朋友挺可爱的 你们两个是不是有情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:04.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:04.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱斯丽？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:07.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. What, are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:07.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你在开玩笑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He asked her out once. It was an embarrassing failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他约过她一次 被无情地拒绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:11.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:11.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:14.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. Was that supposed to be a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:14.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 那是秘密吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's too bad. You guys would make a cute couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太可惜了 你们两个会是一对璧人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:21.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, dear. -What's the matter?
