Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:36.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说莱纳德跟女人在里面？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.26,0:08:41.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, either that or he's lost his tie rack and gotten really into Bryan Adams.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.26,0:08:41.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 不然就是他的领带架丢了 而且他疯狂地爱上了布莱恩亚当斯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:44.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LESLIE [FLATLY]: Oh, Leonard, you magnificent beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:44.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦 莱纳德 你这个雄伟的野兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.69,0:08:50.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We really shouldn't be standing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.69,0:08:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们真的不该站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is very awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:54.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这太尴尬了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:57.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come on. You know, Leonard's had girls over before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:57.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 莱纳德总带过女孩回家吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:09:02.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yes. But there's usually planning, courtship, advance notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:09:02.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 但通常他都会先计划好 出去约会 还有事先通知
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:07.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, last time, I was able to book a cruise to the Arctic to see a solar eclipse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:07.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像上次 我才有时间 预定去北极看日食的游轮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:12.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, wait. You had to leave the state because your roommate was having sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:12.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 你室友要做爱 所以你必须离开本州？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.09,0:09:15.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't have to. The dates just happened to coincide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.09,0:09:15.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不必那么做 是日期刚好撞在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:20.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So do you know who's in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:20.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道谁在里面吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.02,0:09:23.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there's Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.02,0:09:23.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:30.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he's either with Leslie Winkle or a 1930s gangster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:30.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他要不是跟莱斯丽温克尔在一起 就是跟20世纪30年代的黑帮在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:35.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm. Good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:35.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.99,0:09:38.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good for Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.99,0:09:38.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这对莱纳德来说太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:40.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:40.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:42.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, don't. Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:42.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.42,0:09:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's the matter? -I don't know what the protocol is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.42,0:09:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -我不知道礼节上该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I stay? Do I leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该留下还是该离开？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:52.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I wait to greet them with a refreshing beverage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:52.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我应该准备好饮料迎接他们出来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gee, Sheldon, you're asking the wrong girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 谢尔顿 你真的问错人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:58.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm usually on the other side of the tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:58.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通常我是在房间里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:03.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.91,0:10:16.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DIALING]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:21.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:21.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂 莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.50,0:10:26.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.50,0:10:26.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在客厅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:33.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just-- I wanted you to know I saw the tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:33.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是…我只是想让你知道 我看到领带了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:36.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Message received.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:36.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂你的意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.85,0:10:40.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.85,0:10:40.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:45.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You carry on. Give my best to Leslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:45.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你继续 帮我跟莱斯丽问好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:23.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Big Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:23.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.61,0:11:32.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[EXHALES]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.90,0:11:36.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CLEARS THROAT]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Someone touched my board.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人碰过我的白板
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, my board.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 我的白板
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:11:59.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PANTING] Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:11:59.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:03.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:03.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:05.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Equations. Someone's tampered with my equations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:05.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}方程式 有人动过我的方程式
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:07.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you sure? -Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:07.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你确定？ -我当然确定
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:09.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at the beta function of quantum chromodynamics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:09.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看量子色动力学的功能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:12.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The sign's been changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:12.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}符号被动过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:13.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:13.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:16.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But doesn't that fix the problem you've been having?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:16.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是解决了你的问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:18.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you insane? Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:18.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你疯了吗？你脑袋有问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:22.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you--? Hey, look, that fixes the problem I've been having.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:22.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你…对哦 这解决了我的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:25.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:25.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:28.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:28.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是你改的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:31.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. I noticed it when I got up to get water, so I fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:31.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我起来喝水时注意到了 所以就把它改好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now you can show quarks are asymptotically free at high energies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你可以证明夸克 在高能状态时是渐近自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:36.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:36.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很酷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:39.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Cool"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:39.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“酷”？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:41.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, I gotta get to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:41.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我得去实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.05,0:12:44.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for a great night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.05,0:12:44.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你给我美好的一晚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.14,0:12:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you. I'll see you at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.14,0:12:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 上班时见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hold on. Hold on. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-等一下… -怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.48,0:12:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Who told you you could touch my board? -No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.48,0:12:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谁让你碰我的白板的？ -没有人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:56.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't come into your house and touch your board.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:56.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可没跑到你家碰你的白板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:58.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are no incorrect equations on my board.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:58.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的白板上没有不正确的方程式
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:05.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that is so, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:05.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真是太…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:10.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I gotta run. If you come up with an adjective, text me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:10.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 我得走了 等你想好怎么指责我 发短信就好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.00,0:13:14.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.00,0:13:18.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不为人着想 我想这样指责她 不为人着想
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:18.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Inconsiderate. That is the adjective. Inconsiderate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can stare at your board all day, she's still going to be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以整天盯着白板看 谢尔顿 她还是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:24.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: I'm not staring, I'm mulling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:24.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是在盯着它看 我是在沉思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:26.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, hey, Leonard. -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 -嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:31.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[TEASING] So how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:31.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如何啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IMITATES PENNY] Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:39.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just pretty good? I'd think you were doing very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:39.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是还不错？我觉得你做得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.99,0:13:44.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Pretty, very." There's really no objective scale for delineating variations of good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.99,0:13:44.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“还不错 非常好” 好不好没有客观的评价标准
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:47.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:47.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么会那么问？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.33,0:13:51.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, a little bird told me that you and Leslie hooked up last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.33,0:13:51.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一只小小鸟跟我说 昨晚你和莱斯丽在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.04,0:13:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon! SHELDON: I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.04,0:13:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿！ -来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:58.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So is it serious? Do you like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:58.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们是认真的吗？你喜欢她吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:00.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's really two different questions. I'm not--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是两个不同的问题 我不…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.89,0:14:07.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.89,0:14:07.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我们得走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:12.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, you're wound awfully tight for a man who just had sexual intercourse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:12.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 对刚刚性交过的男人来说 你还真是紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:17.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, well, I'll talk to you later. But I am so happy for you, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:17.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我们随后再聊 但我很为你感到高兴 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:20.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:20.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.44,0:14:22.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:26.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did she mean, she's happy for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:26.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她说她为我高兴是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.16,0:14:29.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is she happy because I'm seeing someone or because she thinks I'm happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.16,0:14:29.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是因为我跟别人在一起 还是因为她觉得我很开心？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.95,0:14:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because anyone who cared for someone would want them to be happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.95,0:14:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你关心一个人的话 就会希望对方开心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.16,0:14:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...even if the reason for their happiness made the first person unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.16,0:14:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}即使他们的开心会让你伤心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:39.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, because the second person, though happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:39.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为对方虽然开心…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:43.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is now romantically unavailable to the first person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:43.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他却不能跟你在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:47.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you realize I may have to share a Nobel Prize with your booty call?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我得跟你的炮友 分享诺贝尔奖吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:52.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:52.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:54.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm being ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:54.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真是太可笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:56.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But who cares what Penny thinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:56.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁在乎佩妮怎么想？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.77,0:15:00.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leslie is a terrific girl. She's attractive. We like each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.77,0:15:00.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱斯丽是个好女孩 她很迷人 我们喜欢彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:01.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's extremely intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:01.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她非常聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:04.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: She's not that intelligent. LEONARD: She fixed your equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:04.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她没有那么聪明 -她帮你解出了方程式
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: She got lucky. LEONARD: You don't believe in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她是运气好 -你不相信运气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:09.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have to believe in it for her to be lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:09.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不必相信运气 就知道她是运气好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:13.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Regardless, I have a chance at a real relationship with Leslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:13.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不论如何 但我跟莱斯丽 还是有希望成为情侣的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:16.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna pass that up for some hypothetical future happiness...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:16.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会为了一个 我不知道希不希望我快乐的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:19.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with a woman who may or may not want me to be happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而错过未来可能让我幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:23.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with the woman who is currently making me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:23.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以及现在让我快乐的那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:25.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Leonard. LEONARD: Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:25.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 -怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.55,0:15:27.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: I still don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.55,0:15:27.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:37.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Leslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:37.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 莱斯丽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:40.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Careful, Leonard. Liquid nitrogen, 320 degrees below zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:40.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小心 莱纳德 这是液态氮 零下320度
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:44.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Brrrr. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are you smashing a flash-frozen banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么要捣烂急冻香蕉？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:55.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I got a bowl of Cheerios and I couldn't find a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:55.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我要吃早餐玉米片 找不到刀子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:16:01.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So anyway, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:16:01.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:07.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just extending the intimacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:07.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}延伸亲密感
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:10.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, do you wanna slip over to the radiation lab...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:10.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想不想溜到辐射实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.34,0:16:13.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and share a decontamination shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.34,0:16:13.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟我一起洗消毒鸳鸯浴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:20.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, what exactly do you think's going on between us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得我们是什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:25.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not sure, but I think I'm about to discover how the banana felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:25.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 但我想我很快就会知道香蕉的感觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:33.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Neither of us are neuroscientists, but we both understand the biochemistry of sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:33.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我们都不是神经学家 但我们都了解性交的生化性质
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:37.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dopamine in our brains is released across synapses, causing pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:37.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}脑部释放的多巴胺经过神经突触 产生欢愉的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stick electrodes in a rat's brain, give him an orgasm button.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将电极插到老鼠的脑袋里 按下高潮按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He'll push that thing until he starves to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它会兴奋到饿死为止
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.17,0:16:45.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, who wouldn't? Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.17,0:16:45.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁不会呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:47.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The difference between us and the rat...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:47.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们和老鼠的不同是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is you can't stick an electrode in our hypothalamus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能将电极插在我们的下丘脑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:51.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's where you come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:51.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这时候就得靠你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, I'm just glad to be a part of it. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我很高兴能够参与
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:58.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what happens now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:58.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那现在怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.02,0:17:02.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I don't know about your sex drive, but I'm probably good till New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.02,0:17:02.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道你的性冲动周期 但我应该能撑到新年
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:05.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:07.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:07.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:10.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:10.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢你 -谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:16.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You wanna make plans for New Year's? -Please, you're smothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:16.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-新年计划 你要先约好吗？ -拜托 莱纳德 你让我觉得窒息
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:18.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:18.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, look. It's Dr. Stud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:22.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 快看啊 是种马博士
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:24.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doctor what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:24.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么博士？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:27.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The blogosphere is abuzzing with news of you and Leslie...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:27.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}博客上疯传说你跟莱斯丽温克尔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:30.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...making the bang, bang music.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:30.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}琴瑟和鸣的大消息
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.05,0:17:34.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, how did it get on the Internet? -I put it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.05,0:17:34.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么传到网上了？ -是我放上去的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:37.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, how did you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:37.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你又怎么会知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:38.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A little bird told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:38.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一只小小鸟告诉我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:42.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently, you are a magnificent beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:42.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然你是头雄伟的野兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:47.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that part's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:47.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那部分倒是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.65,0:17:53.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I may have misjudged this restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.65,0:17:53.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我错看了这家餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:56.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No kidding. -I don't wanna go out on a limb...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没错 -我不想乱说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:59.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I think we may be looking at my new Tuesday hamburger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:59.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我想这或许是我的新星期二汉堡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your old Tuesday hamburger will be so brokenhearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的旧星期二汉堡会心碎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Way ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:05.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经先你一步料到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:10.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was thinking of moving Big Boy to Thursdays and just dropping Souplantation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:10.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想把大男孩移到星期四 取消汤菜园
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.30,0:18:12.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.30,0:18:12.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的吗？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.67,0:18:16.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The name always confused me, anyway. Souplantation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.67,0:18:16.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正我一直想不透 怎么会有汤菜园这种名字
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.10,0:18:18.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't grow soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.10,0:18:18.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}汤又不能种
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:23.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So how's everything? -Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:23.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么样？ -非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:28.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll be happy to know I plan to come every Tuesday for the foreseeable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:28.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该会很高兴 未来每星期二晚上我都会来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:31.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Oh, yay. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:31.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.94,0:18:34.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who do I speak to about permanently reserving this table?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.94,0:18:34.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该跟谁谈永久预订这个位置的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.57,0:18:38.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know, a psychiatrist?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.57,0:18:38.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 精神医生吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: So, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:44.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How are things with you and Leslie? -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:44.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟莱斯丽怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:47.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To be honest, I don't think it's going to work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:47.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老实说 我们不会在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:51.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that's too bad. Well, hey, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:51.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太可惜了 嘿 别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:55.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure there's someone out there who's just right for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:55.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你一定会找到适合你的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:19:00.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what did she mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:19:00.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她这又是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was that just a generic platitude or was that a subtle bid for attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是客套的安慰还是微妙的暗示？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.35,0:19:10.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know why this hamburger surpasses the Big Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.35,0:19:10.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道为什么这个汉堡 比大男孩那里的汉堡好吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.11,0:19:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a single-decker, whereas the Big Boy is a double-decker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.11,0:19:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里的是单层汉堡肉 大男孩的是双层汉堡肉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:18.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This has a much more satisfying meat-to-bun-to-condiment ratio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:18.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就肉、面包跟调味料的比例来说 这个汉堡的口感更让人满足
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:21.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you even listening to me? -Of course I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:21.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在听我说话吗？ -我当然在听
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.83,0:19:25.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Blah, blah, hopeless Penny delusion, blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.83,0:19:25.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇啦哇啦 对佩妮无望的幻想 哇啦哇啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:29.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:29.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, you can grow the ingredients for soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}汤里面的材料是种出来的
